    {
      "id": "te91",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1405,
      "width": 1415.68,
      "height": 120.0,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 448315526,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 946239001,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1 Requester submits a goal with a pass/fail predicate and a budget; the API checks login, tier and quota\n2 The Planner (an LLM) drafts tasks, each with a predicate \u03a6; the predicate service checks each \u03a6; the requester approves the plan\n3 The requester picks an agent (Thompson sampling over posteriors from P4); the scheduler places it in an attested enclave, which signs the receipt\n4 Receipt body goes to the store; its Merkle root and attestation reference go on chain; the requester gets a signed pre-commitment\n5 The orchestrator moves on the \u03a6 result the enclave recorded; a validator audits a sample p; anyone can post a bond and challenge; Escrow releases or refunds\n6 Validated outcomes and metered cost feed the reputation engine, which feeds the Router. Only validated outcomes count",
      "originalText": "1 Requester submits a goal with a pass/fail predicate and a budget; the API checks login, tier and quota\n2 The Planner (an LLM) drafts tasks, each with a predicate \u03a6; the predicate service checks each \u03a6; the requester approves the plan\n3 The requester picks an agent (Thompson sampling over posteriors from P4); the scheduler places it in an attested enclave, which signs the receipt\n4 Receipt body goes to the store; its Merkle root and attestation reference go on chain; the requester gets a signed pre-commitment\n5 The orchestrator moves on the \u03a6 result the enclave recorded; a validator audits a sample p; anyone can post a bond and challenge; Escrow releases or refunds\n6 Validated outcomes and metered cost feed the reputation engine, which feeds the Router. Only validated outcomes count",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "te92",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 20,
      "y": 1539.0,
      "width": 1411.2,
      "height": 18.75,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#868e96",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 348543443,
      "version": 1,
      "versionNonce": 236069245,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Solid = request path \u00b7 Dashed = attestation, commitments, feedback \u00b7 Tags: OPEN = undecided (see HLD \u00a711), PROPOSED = recommended, not locked \u00b7 Nothing here is measured",
      "originalText": "Solid = request path \u00b7 Dashed = attestation, commitments, feedback \u00b7 Tags: OPEN = undecided (see HLD \u00a711), PROPOSED = recommended, not locked \u00b7 Nothing here is measured",
      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
